{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of brave, mischievous rats in Mischief, the full action-adventure experience from Tavern Rat Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant neighborhood from a rat\u2019s-eye view as you scurry, scamper, and scheme your way through creative co-op challenges, zany minigames, and unforgettable boss battles. Designed for couch co-op chaos and heartfelt fun, Mischief reimagines classic multiplayer adventures for a new generation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/04c6ee4257e47efdfeb87ad82574712e.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/04c6ee4257e47efdfeb87ad82574712e.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/04c6ee4257e47efdfeb87ad82574712e.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> Chaotic Co-op Adventures</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to four local players and dive into an imaginative world brimming with charm and challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against larger-than-life household bosses like Shovul, Scourge of the Sandbox and Oscar, Pup of the Pit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everyday objects like crayons, ketchup, and surge protectors in clever ways to overcome obstacles and prank your foes. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/ef45457ec0ce530c23e02e0358e0c01b.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/ef45457ec0ce530c23e02e0358e0c01b.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/ef45457ec0ce530c23e02e0358e0c01b.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> Competitive PvP Minigames</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break from teamwork and compete head-to-head in a variety of fast-paced minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes in a zany shooting gallery where precision is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your friends on chaotic, obstacle-filled rat tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver rivals in a platforming showdown where only one rat can reign supreme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more games to unlock and master!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A <strong>World of Whimsy and Wonder</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore richly detailed environments built from everyday objects, viewed through the eyes of a rat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve co-op puzzles that require communication and creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and celebrate your wins with over 100 unique achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mischief is a joyful blend of teamwork, rivalry, and chaos\u2014a local multiplayer adventure that\u2019s easy to pick up and impossible to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Do participate in the Rat Race","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/92d363e7e104534d2f4df83e6acd41e4f7f380a5.jpg"},{"name":"Do jump on the trampoline","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/60b2511eff228a147c2f43d1f94729c6bf432cd6.jpg"},{"name":"Do spin the merry go round","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/319a211c1cb7d9ba255e6f1edb27ddb157aa3ed2.jpg"},{"name":"Do find balance on the see saw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/a26a6d85c60f6f3b0bf836c571d93667732d5cef.jpg"},{"name":"Do make some wind music","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/b393b82d7560d4dc5d7cde6d7d4e4f7feb0ba41a.jpg"},{"name":"Do score a goal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/ca1a2a88145255a74e826ed3567cc4242bf84378.jpg"},{"name":"Do sit atop the pedal machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/c99424a38771dcf9cc5b44548fd2efed285cf379.jpg"},{"name":"Do find the easter egg","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/a86ce581fe300dd77bcb1c2de00f0615f62d0510.jpg"},{"name":"Do get on squeaking terms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/84d44cdc3d38a2fdc40981e33f884de34f58e298.jpg"},{"name":"Do play hopscotch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844360/d7c0f1521aebefca46a867aca2691c94af12f814.jpg"}],"total":100},"background":"ht