iends on chaotic, obstacle-filled rat tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver rivals in a platforming showdown where only one rat can reign supreme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more games to unlock and master!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A <strong>World of Whimsy and Wonder</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore richly detailed environments built from everyday objects, viewed through the eyes of a rat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve co-op puzzles that require communication and creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and celebrate your wins with over 100 unique achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mischief is a joyful blend of teamwork, rivalry, and chaos\u2014a local multiplayer adventure that\u2019s easy to pick up and impossible to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Tavern Rat Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/b2c454c9df707aea791cccd42e06bfda5415dadb/header.jpg?t=1755194545","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum: